  "what_this_release_delivers": [
    "Constrains Micro Kart CPU drivers to strictly binary keyboard-equivalent steering (left, right, or none, plus independent brake — no steerAnalog) through the 0.55 s linear thruster ramp, caps each CPU to max 2 actions/sec (500 ms interval), and staggers each CPU's 0.5 s decision clock across the cycle so rivals never synchronize (@yolo-arcade/game-micro-kart@1.7.3)."
